<h1 id=3D"ARI-D(Dynamiccolumns)-1.Structure">1.&nbsp;Structure</h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"full-width" data-local-id=3D"860b5308-ca1b-46d2-870e-=
e6912cdee16a" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col>
<col style=3D"width: 197.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 413.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 637.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTh"></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue1">column name </span></p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue1">column description </span></p></=
th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue1">remarks</span></p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">1</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>tlc</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>3-letter destination codes corresponding with locations defined in <a hr=
ef=3D"/wiki/spaces/UM/pages/165773613/Blender" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1=
65773613" data-linked-resource-version=3D"10" data-linked-resource-type=3D"=
page">Resfinity Blender </a></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>one or multiple comma-separated values</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">2</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>mhc</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>master hotel code</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>anixe's master hotel code</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">3</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>room_code</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>code corresponding with room type<br>
(by default, one of following, corresponding with room's occupancy type: SR=
, DR, TR, QR)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>clients can define their own room codes corresponding with the default o=
nes, or based corresponding with their own definitions of <a href=3D"/wiki/=
spaces/UM/pages/165675179/Dynamic+Room+Types" data-linked-resource-id=3D"16=
5675179" data-linked-resource-version=3D"27" data-linked-resource-type=3D"p=
age">Dynamic Room Types</a> mapping rules.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">4</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>ext_code</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>field for internal use only</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>-</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">5</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>meal_code</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>one of following meal codes: RO,SC, BB, HB, FB, AI</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>clients can define their own meal codes corresponding with the default o=
nes, so that they'd be used in the export instead, eg.:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>RO&nbsp;=E2=86=92 U</p></li>
<li>
<p>BB&nbsp;=E2=86=92 F</p></li>
<li>
<p>AI&nbsp;=E2=86=92 I</p></li>
<li>
<p>HB&nbsp;=E2=86=92H<br>
etc.</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">6</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>checkin</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>check-in date</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>format: <strong>yyyymmdd</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">7</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>adt</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>exact number of adults required in room</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>value: 1-4</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">8</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>chd</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>exact number of children required in room</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>value: 0-2</p>
<p>Please note that ARI-D is calculated with CHD age =3D 11, for all suppli=
ers.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">9</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>prices</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>total prices for the room for consecutive stay durations</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>format: [stay length]=3D[price]:[provider]</p></li>
<li>
<p>one or multiple semicolon-separated values</p></li>
<li>
<p>no entries for stay durations were there were no prices provided by the =
suppliers</p></li>
<li>
<p>by default: <strong>total</strong><br>
optional: <strong>per pax </strong>[total/(adt+chd)]</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">10</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span data-colorid=3D"uq6ruz9xqq">room_name</span> <span class=
=3D"legacy-color-text-blue5">(optional)</span></strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Dynamic Room name</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><a href=3D"/wiki/spaces/UM/pages/165675179/Dynamic+Room+Types" data-link=
ed-resource-id=3D"165675179" data-linked-resource-version=3D"27" data-linke=
d-resource-type=3D"page">Dynamic Room Types</a>&nbsp;name corresponding wit=
h the code from col. 3 (as defined in Resfinity Res)<br>
If not activated for the export, this data is not included in ("prices" bei=
ng the last column of data)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">11</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span data-colorid=3D"tqfwsiz9u2">Non Refundable Information&nbs=
p;</span><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue5">(optional)</span></strong>=
</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>The marker if the offer is non refundable</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Value: N - in case if it is non refundable</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Empty - if it is fully refundable or =
fee applies</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><strong>Delimiter:</strong> pipe ("|")</p>
<p><strong>Quotation:</strong> none</p>
